WEBVTT
NOTE smp12-v3-3-1 en — new narration (Fahad, 2026-10-20); captions spread across the speech by word count (not from the audio): check by eye

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.968
Our mission as marshals is simple.

2
00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:16.306
Safety first: we watch how crowded our area is and report early, keep exits and routes clear, act on instructions, raise the alarm and help people out in an emergency.

3
00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:26.088
And service always: host, direct, inform, assist and support every fan - from the moment they arrive to the moment they leave.

4
00:00:26.288 --> 00:00:29.200
You'll learn exactly how in Module 2.
